<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F8.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S5.F8.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">SSIM vs. SNR (AWGN)</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S5.F8.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.07363v1/figure5a.svg" id="S5.F8.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/442;" width="476" height="442"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F8.sf3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(c)</span> </span><span id="S5.F8.sf3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PSNR vs. SNR (Rayleigh)</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S5.F8.sf4" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.07363v1/figure5b.svg" id="S5.F8.sf4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/442;" width="476" height="442"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F8.sf4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(d)</span> </span><span id="S5.F8.sf4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">SSIM vs. SNR (Rayleigh)</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 8</span>: </span><span id="S5.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance comparison on FFHQ-256 dataset under AWGN and Rayleigh fading channels (2UE, <math id="S5.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho=1/48" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho=1/48</annotation></semantics></math>). Subfigures (a) and (b) show PSNR and SSIM versus SNR under AWGN channel, while subfigures (c) and (d) show PSNR and SSIM under Rayleigh fading channel.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
